<!--BlockDoc Documentation — DesignDecisions
  FQN: org.blockml.bml.target.blockdoc.documentation.DesignDecisions-->
<bddocumentation:DesignDecisions xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.bml.core"
  xmlns:bddocumentation="org.blockml.bml.target.blockdoc.documentation">

  <baseType>
    core:Documentation
  </baseType>
  <is>
    Normative BlockDoc decisions BD1–BD28
  </is>
  <documentation>
    # Normative BlockDoc decisions BD1–BD28
    
    - BD1 siteMode merged vs perLibrary.
    - BD2 outLayout fqn vs package (package may collide when multiple blocks share a package).
    - BD3 option defaults: merged / fqn / includeNonExported=true.
    - BD4 registry name blockdoc; accepts library|corpus|auto.
    - BD5 shared minimal CSS profile.
    - BD6 block page section order (PageSectionOrder).
    - BD7 FqnToHtmlPath algebra.
    - BD8 no FQN dl / no block-page breadcrumb.
    - BD9 RelativeHref algebra.
    - BD10 EscapeHtml.
    - BD11 CollectRootFqns = shortest per file.
    - BD12 package prefix ancestor set for indexes.
    - BD13 export filter via Library.blocks aggregation.
    - BD14 member-value summary limit 5.
    - BD15 type-link policy (named+known only).
    - BD16 sub-block simple-name resolve.
    - BD17 member table kinds and columns.
    - BD18 composition group order/dedupe.
    - BD19 composition node / directive labels.
    - BD20 dotted package path linking.
    - BD21 site index grouping: one library by package; two or more libraries by library then package.
    - BD22 package index direct blocks/sub-packages + breadcrumb.
    - BD23 AssembleSite orchestration including library prefix = strip .Library.
    - BD24 BuildSearchIndex — search-index.json plus inlined search.js of every emitted block page.
    - BD25 sticky black toolbar (BlockDoc + Index + All Blocks + keyword quick search) on all HTML pages.
    - BD26 when session.corpusRoots is set, restrict emitted FQNs to files under those roots.
    - BD27 site home is the first interesting package prefix (skip levels with one sub-package and no blocks); merged index.html redirects there when outLayout=fqn; the former site listing is all-blocks.html (toolbar All Blocks).
    - BD28 inherited member type: local member with no authored type uses the nearest ancestor (baseType chain / contracts) member of the same identity that has a type; em dash only when none exists.
  </documentation>
  <references>
    <see type="bddocumentation:PackageOwnership" relation="ReadNext" />
  </references>
</bddocumentation:DesignDecisions>
